  "problem": "Which of the following random variables can be modeled as a discrete uniform distribution?\n\nI. The number obtained when picking a real number between $0$ and $1$ at random.\n\nII. The number obtained when picking an integer between $20$ and $30$ at random.\n\nIII. The number of incidents that occur on a particular road in a month.",
